# Klear stroke iconography

Use the **homepage tier list** look everywhere in `.mirrored-root`:

| Property | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Wrapper | `icon-chip icon-chip--bare` |
| Size | `--icon-chip-size: 22px` |
| ViewBox | `0 0 24 24` |
| Stroke | `1.5`, `round` caps/joins |
| Fill | `none` |
| Color | `stroke="currentColor"` (ink on light, white on `.tier--dark`) |

Implement new icons via `klearStrokeSvg()` / `klearStrokeIconChip()` in `src/lib/klear-stroke-icons.ts`. Global enforcement lives in `public/css/klear-iconography.css`.

Avoid filled `icon-chip` tiles on KlearData/KlearHub foundation and module cards unless the design explicitly calls for an exception.
